# React TSX Frontend Skill

## Stack

* React
* Vite
* TypeScript
* TailwindCSS
* Zustand
* React Router

## Component Rules

* Use functional components
* Use hooks
* Use TypeScript interfaces
* Keep components small

## File Structure

```
frontend/
 ├── src/
 │    ├── pages/
 │    ├── components/
 │    ├── hooks/
 │    ├── store/
 │    ├── services/
 │    └── layouts/
```

## TSX Rules

* Never use any type
* Prefer interfaces over types
* Strongly type props
* Use reusable components

## UI Rules

* Use TailwindCSS
* Mobile-first design
* Avoid inline styles

## State Management

* Use Zustand for global state
* Keep local state minimal

## API Integration

* Use Axios
* Separate API logic into services folder
* Never call APIs directly inside UI components

## Naming Conventions

* PascalCase for components
* camelCase for variables
* kebab-case for folders
